  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Primrose the Rikka Fairy Duo",
      "effect": "If a monster(s) is Tributed (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon in Defense Position, both this card from your hand and 1 \"Rikka\" monster from your Deck, except \"Primrose the Rikka Fairy Duo\", also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn, except Plant monsters. You can target 1 Plant monster you control; increase or decrease its Level by 2. During your opponent's Main Phase, you can (Quick Effect): Immediately after this effect resolves, Xyz Summon 1 Plant Xyz Monster. You can only use each effect of \"Primrose the Rikka Fairy Duo\" once per turn."
    },
    "ja": {
